row one-quest-start npc=darin bypass=npc_{darin}_Quest seed=- after=Q001_LettersOfLove:CREATED last=darin
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=darin item=0 html="<html><body>Darin:<br>\nDo you know what is more dangerous than a knight's sword or a magician's spell? It is love. It comes unexpectedly and swallows a man's entire soul, and never releases it. This thing called love is what makes me so happy and agonized these days. I have no motivation or appetite... I'm so disappointed in myself.<br>\n<a action=\"bypass -h Quest Q001_LettersOfLove 30048-03.htm\">Ask who Darin's love is</a>\n</body></html>\n"
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
row one-quest-start-not-talk-first npc=roxxy bypass=npc_{roxxy}_Quest seed=- after=Q006_StepIntoTheFuture:CREATED last=roxxy
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=roxxy item=0 html="<html><body>Gatekeeper Roxxy:<br>\nI'm very lucky! My job allows me to travel all around the continent.<br>\nFrom the metropolis of Aden to the bustling streets of Giran, not to mention the magnificnet Heine, each place is wonderful in its own way! I've met many different kinds of people in my travels.<br>\nNaturally, I returned to my home on Talking Island; it was the most comfortable place to me. I hope to travel again someday. I especially miss the night life in Giran!<br>\n<a action=\"bypass -h Quest Q006_StepIntoTheFuture 30006-03.htm\">\"I want to go to Giran!\"</a>\n</body></html>\n"
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
