provenance probe java=55ff8a4ec7e186d9816cd549246b4cf1f59c9f12 datapack=55ff8a4ec7e186d9816cd549246b4cf1f59c9f12
note Quest.equals over loaded scripts: any two behaviors (DefaultNpc subclasses) are equal; two scripts with the same positive id are equal when their names match; otherwise equal when the class names match.
